{"product":{"id":8061224452174,"title":"Lattafa Bestsellers Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover five popular Lattafa fragrances in one curated sample set, bringing together creamy sweetness, soft florals, rich gourmand warmth and smooth, comforting depth. From everyday feminine scents to the distinctive character of Khamrah Qahwa, this collection offers plenty of variety to explore.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLattafa Yara\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A creamy, sweet fragrance with fruity, floral and vanilla facets. Soft, feminine and easy to wear.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLattafa Angham\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A warm, elegant blend with sweet, fruity and aromatic touches. Smooth, cozy and effortlessly inviting.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLattafa Eclaire\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A rich gourmand fragrance with a creamy, milky sweetness and warm vanilla character. Delicious, comforting and indulgent.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLattafa Her Confession\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A sophisticated fragrance combining soft florals, warm sweetness and deeper woody nuances. Feminine, sensual and refined.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLattafa Khamrah Qahwa\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A warm, spicy gourmand with coffee, cinnamon and sweet vanilla facets. Rich, cozy and especially appealing for evenings.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFive Lattafa favorites, five different moods — an easy way to compare the collection and discover which one deserves a full bottle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-11T15:51:03+05:30","handle":"lattafa-signature-sample-set-yara-angham-eclaire-her-confession-khamrah-qahwa-5-1-5ml","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:54:36+05:30","published_at":"2026-09-15T13:56:40+05:30","template_suffix":"discovery-set5","published_scope":"web","tags":"","variants":[{"id":44310364782670,"product_id":8061224452174,"title":"Default Title","price":"599.00","sku":"BND-UPS6BA","position":1,"compare_at_price":"899.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-11T15:51:03+05:30","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:54:36+05:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"INR","compare_at_price_currency":"INR","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":10213258592334,"product_id":8061224452174,"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}],"images":[{"id":55784968880206,"product_id":8061224452174,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-09-11T17:10:20+05:30","updated_at":"2026-09-11T17:10:22+05:30","alt":null,"width":2000,"height":2000,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0591\/0180\/6670\/files\/Untitled_design_0d888a8b-581e-4d2c-9b4d-a24ca5f01dcf.jpg?v=1789126822","variant_ids":[]},{"id":52165850366030,"product_id":8061224452174,"position":2,"created_at":"2026-07-03T14:22:17+05:30","updated_at":"2026-07-03T14:22:18+05:30","alt":null,"width":1000,"height":1000,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0591\/0180\/6670\/files\/1st_5_Discovery_Set.png?v=1783068738","variant_ids":[]},{"id":52165850660942,"product_id":8061224452174,"position":3,"create